cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or code, please cite them as below."
title: "Placebo ESP experiments: data and code"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Savva
    given-names: Louie
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-21
repository-code: "https://github.com/louiesavva/placebo-esp-randomness"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Hit counts for 38,016,682 placebo ESP experiments of Spencer-Brown's
  morning-afternoon design using atmospheric-noise random numbers from
  random.org, with smaller pseudo-random and hardware series, two
  digit-matching series and a Zener-card series of 473,594 experiments,
  plus code for every table in "Anomalous
  Significance Revisited" and "Too Many Miracles".
keywords:
  - binomial distribution
  - normal approximation
  - random number generators
  - parapsychology
  - placebo experiments
